      "user_id": 1,
      "title": "Nexus Platform",
      "slug": "nexus-platform",
      "summary": "An enterprise-grade SaaS infrastructure designed for high-availability distributed systems.",
      "description": "## The Challenge\n\nExisting solutions struggled with real-time state synchronization across multiple regions, leading to high latency for global users. The goal was a system that maintains sub-100ms response times with strict data consistency.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- Real-time delta-sync reducing bandwidth by 60%\n- Zero-trust mTLS + JWT auth at every microservice boundary\n- Native Prometheus + OpenTelemetry observability\n- Custom HPA controllers based on request latency",
      "status": "published",
      "is_featured": true,
      "client": "Nexus Inc.",
      "role_on_project": "Lead Systems Architect",
