      "description": "A distributed compute engine built on Kubernetes that orchestrates batch and streaming workloads across global regions.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Custom scheduling atop K8s for cost-efficient batch jobs\n- Exactly-once semantics via idempotent state stores\n- Terabyte-scale ingestion at 40GB/s sustained throughput",
